docs {
  # Admin Get Social Growth Settings

  Admin uses this to see the current social growth configuration before editing it.

  This is the safest first request for the admin dashboard because it returns the exact values the backend is using.

  ## Endpoint

  `GET /api/v1/admin/services/social-growth/settings`

  ## Authentication

  Admin JWT required:

  ```txt
  Authorization: Bearer {{authToken}}
  ```

  The logged-in user must have:

  ```json
  {
    "role": "admin"
  }
  ```

  Normal users and vendors must not call this endpoint.

  ## When To Call This

  Call this when:

  - the admin opens the Social Growth settings page
  - the admin clicks refresh
  - the admin saves settings and you want to show the latest saved values

  ## Expected Success Response

  Status: `200 OK`

  ```json
  {
    "settings": {
      "id": "66...",
      "service": "social_growth",
      "isEnabled": true,
      "activeProvider": "exosupplier",
      "availableProviders": [
        {
          "name": "exosupplier",
          "available": true
        },
        {
          "name": "vheeboost",
          "available": true
        }
      ],
      "userMarkupPercent": 15,
      "vendorMarkupPercent": 10,
      "usdToNgnRate": 1600,
      "userPricingTiers": [
        { "minCost": 0, "maxCost": 1000, "markupPercent": 15 },
        { "minCost": 1001, "maxCost": 5000, "markupPercent": 10 },
        { "minCost": 5001, "maxCost": 15000, "markupPercent": 7 },
        { "minCost": 15001, "maxCost": 50000, "markupPercent": 5 },
        { "minCost": 50001, "maxCost": null, "markupPercent": 3 }
      ],
      "vendorPricingTiers": [
        { "minCost": 0, "maxCost": 1000, "markupPercent": 10 },
        { "minCost": 1001, "maxCost": 5000, "markupPercent": 7 },
        { "minCost": 5001, "maxCost": 15000, "markupPercent": 5 },
        { "minCost": 15001, "maxCost": 50000, "markupPercent": 3 },
        { "minCost": 50001, "maxCost": null, "markupPercent": 2 }
      ],
      "roundingMode": "ceil",
      "updatedBy": "66...",
      "createdAt": "2026-07-07T08:00:00.000Z",
      "updatedAt": "2026-07-07T08:30:00.000Z"
    }
  }
  ```

  ## Field Meaning

  `isEnabled`
  `true` means users can fetch services, quote, and place orders. `false` disables social growth purchases.

  `activeProvider`
  Provider used by the backend when fetching services and creating orders. Supported values are `exosupplier` and `vheeboost`.

  `availableProviders`
  List of providers the backend code currently supports. Use this to build a provider dropdown.

  `usdToNgnRate`
  Exchange rate used when the active provider returns prices in USD. Providers that already return NGN prices do not need conversion.

  `userMarkupPercent`
  Fallback markup for normal users if no tier matches the calculated provider cost.

  `vendorMarkupPercent`
  Fallback markup for active vendors if no tier matches the calculated provider cost.

  `userPricingTiers`
  Tiered markup rules for normal users.

  `vendorPricingTiers`
  Tiered markup rules for active vendors.

  `roundingMode`
  `ceil` rounds prices up to the next naira. `round` uses normal rounding.

  ## Admin Dashboard Notes

  Show `isEnabled` as a switch.

  Show `activeProvider` as a select/dropdown using `availableProviders`.

  Show pricing tiers as editable rows with `minCost`, `maxCost`, and `markupPercent`.

  Treat `maxCost: null` as "and above" in the UI.

  Do not allow blank `minCost` or `markupPercent` values before saving.

  ## Common Errors

  Missing or expired token:

  ```json
  {
    "message": "Not authorized, no token"
  }
  ```

  User is not admin:

  ```json
  {
    "message": "Not authorized for this role"
  }
  ```
}
